| The Wand of Wishing on the castle level only has one wish in it.
Some times :-(
| You could boost this with a scroll of charging.
                            /\
                          blessed
A WoW can only have 3 charges so only charge when all is used.
There is a chance to get 1 more charge from a used up wand, but this will
disintigrate the wand.
So a wish for a blessed scroll of charging will give you 2(3) more
usefull wishes.

| However, the wishes a wizard can make aren't limited wishes, so
