Don't wish for wishes
Try wishing for a trap. (polymorph trap :-)

Wizard mode *extra* commands:
	^W get a wish
	^I identifys
	^F maps
	^V level tele
	^G create monster
	^O special levels
	^E detect unseen
and
	^X works as in explore mode

